{"title":"2004 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At each basketball practice last week, Jenny made twice as many free throws as she made at the previous practice. At her fifth practice she made <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5afbad0b221f0ef70186fe70b08e6fc1efdd8dfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> free throws. How many free throws did she make at the first practice?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/e/62e270db01b6509e56d62ca7da8ae4d0eefa2e29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 3 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 6 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 9 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 12\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"360\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At the fourth practice she made <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/5/df5ccd40431dabbb57fe351881656833cab65096.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$48/2=24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"18\" /> throws, at the third one it was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a05ee6c16587fef8f2e8fd46a0a684fcad89e55c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24/2=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"20\" />, then we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/a/baa49de83426e65f455c3fbd6c443ce4de8895bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12/2=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" /> throws for the second practice, and finally <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/9/109082a1321c1e33ed68c3c92d71d6bf6856ba59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6/2=3\\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"144\" height=\"32\" /> throws at the first one.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10B\" title=\"2004 AMC 10B\">2004 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10B_Problems/Probl